    "$t": "<h1 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><b>露螺有殼</b></span></h1><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXYRPA8izmlvO0S4llfKbgZWOpVNqsvjcsNh2ymstna11IUSTcbe0V_6INnARZV7qF56Llr57tfw-VP7_5YiIg0Zzsj6YOQAOYJxyqI8s6WHzLWq4maHBYmKj9ObOJwkP5GGcA4iUThzXGI1mmzT2tunzqVOlTmPNGT_tlfI-NZ0K1skgrwzDpMps1vOKs/s2364/l%C5%8Do-l%C3%AA-%C5%AB-khak-%E5%9C%96.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1060\" data-original-width=\"2364\" height=\"286\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXYRPA8izmlvO0S4llfKbgZWOpVNqsvjcsNh2ymstna11IUSTcbe0V_6INnARZV7qF56Llr57tfw-VP7_5YiIg0Zzsj6YOQAOYJxyqI8s6WHzLWq4maHBYmKj9ObOJwkP5GGcA4iUThzXGI1mmzT2tunzqVOlTmPNGT_tlfI-NZ0K1skgrwzDpMps1vOKs/w640-h286/l%C5%8Do-l%C3%AA-%C5%AB-khak-%E5%9C%96.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /><b><br /></b></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>I̍k-liông、阿hîng</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lōo-lê ū khak</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thâu-tíng huat-kak</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kak-tíng senn ba̍k</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē kā lâng tak</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiàm thôo-kha phak</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justif